pane's `AGTERM_LIVE_SESSION` and `AGTERM_LIVE_DIR`, upstream's zmx `ZMX_SESSION` and `ZMX_DIR` (conformance/docs/
rust-build.md > The `live` group). Applied after 0002-ngterm-names.patch; sync-resources.sh reapplies all three to
upstream's plugins/agterm/skills/agterm after every sync.

